README.md Content
# Bank Management System (C++)

## Project Overview
This is a console-based Bank Management System developed using C++.  
The project demonstrates Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts and file handling.

## Features
- Create Account
- Deposit Money
- Withdraw Money
- Balance Inquiry
- Persistent Data Storage

## Technologies Used
- C++
- File Handling
- OOP Concepts

## How to Run

### Compile
```bash
g++ bank.cpp -o bank
Execute
./bank
File Used
bank.dat → Stores customer records
Future Enhancements
Password Authentication
GUI Interface
Database Integration
